' Timers, sprites and the switcher
TIMER 1, 60 CALL Tick
TIMER 2, 6 CALL Blink
TIMER 2 OFF
TIMER 2 ON
TIMER 2 STOP
ball$ = PICTURE$("Ball.pic")
SPRITE 2, ball$
SPRITE 2 AT 100, 100
SPRITE 2 ON
SPRITE 2 OFF
FOR i% = 1 TO TASKS: PRINT TASK$(i%): NEXT
t = TI
PRINT TI$, TIME$, DATE$
ASIDE
WAIT EVENTS
SUB Tick: PRINT TIME$: END SUB
SUB Blink: INVERT 0, 0, 7, 7: END SUB
